[{"title":"萧氏东隐（其曾祖之号）","author":"邓雅","text":"旧隐依东郭，高风仰昔人。\n栋梁经几世，文物见诸孙。\n书学萧家草，家非原宪贫。\n田园深雨露，篱落带松筠。\n凉月琴尊夜，朝曦户牖春。\n鸟啼知节序，燕寝适寒温。\n耕凿当平世，诗书裕后昆。\n何须慕轩冕，俯仰信乾坤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31689,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜宿黄氏山庄","author":"邓雅","text":"为爱溪山好，来游趁晚凉。\n淡烟芳草径，华屋白云庄。\n环合峰千叠，阴森树两行。\n制衣思薜荔，濯足爱沧浪。\n地胜嚣尘远，居幽兴味长。\n移床风涤暑，展席月流光。\n共说青囊秘，频分紫笋香。\n明朝携竹杖，重与望前冈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31690,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送□进士","author":"邓雅","text":"昔记王洲别，今看万里行。\n赤心归圣主，白首济苍生。\n名为文章著，时逢海岱清。\n从容谈礼乐，次第取公卿。\n日月明金殿，莺花绕凤城。\n遥知公退暇，细阅石渠经。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31691,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重题黄伯原友鹤轩","author":"邓雅","text":"幽轩谁作伴，老鹤日相亲。\n起舞能娱客，飞来不避人。\n雪霜明羽翮，风月助精神。\n岂羡乘轩贵，曾看度海频。\n神仙元是友，鸾凤可为邻。\n警露声何远，摩霄意自驯。\n物情殊品类，人道共彝伦。\n一曲南飞调，因之更祝身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31692,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄刘隐君云庄","author":"邓雅","text":"前代衣冠数二刘，云仍几叶学弓裘。\n吟诗自可传千里，习隐惟闻守一丘。\n门外竹松还引径，花间池沼更通流。\n藏修有道书连屋，富贵无心雪满头。\n久喜孙登同啸傲，却如颜阖避徵求。\n冥鸿一去云霄迥，白鹤孤飞岛屿幽。\n对月想弹流水操，乘风未汎剡川舟。\n相思日夕情如海，何日芳尊话倡酬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31693,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题白沙陈氏翠竹间","author":"邓雅","text":"千亩何须说渭川，白沙翠竹尚依然。\n偶从深处开三径，似觉高风继七贤。\n长夏清阴宜枕簟，四时佳兴寓觞弦。\n绕檐迥觉红尘远，巢凤争看彩羽鲜。\n待长龙孙应万个，欲裁汗简可千年。\n知君浩有淇园想，题遍琅玕复几联。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31694,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽邹主簿应端","author":"邓雅","text":"青枫江上结愁云，一曲哀歌泪欲吞。\n富贵昔年成底事，山川何处吊孤魂。\n茫茫天地无穷恨，耿耿心怀莫共论。\n明月未归华表鹤，高风宁羡北溟鲲。\n半生身世才名误，万卷诗书手泽存。\n令子承家亲尚健，衣冠仍数道乡门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31695,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄张助教美和","author":"邓雅","text":"圣主无为万国清，先生归隐一身轻。\n宠荣百世留宸翰，辛苦平生在圣经。\n闭户日长恒著述，杖藜身老尚逢迎。\n吟看碧嶂清江雨，梦绕红楼紫禁城。\n四皓已能成远业，二疏还可并高名。\n朝廷自昔尊耆旧，乡邑如今重典刑。\n远想风流嗟未识，独惭疏懒苦无成。\n风骚谩效当时体，韶濩犹怀太古声。\n俯仰乾坤同此道，睽离南北复何情。\n寄诗为说相思意，更约山中煮茯苓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31696,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽刘廉使楚奇","author":"邓雅","text":"白鹭青原钟淑气，凤凰芝草见祯祥。\n朝廷有道需才杰，岭海无虞佐宪纲。\n暂假风霜清瘴疠，祗将忠孝感穹苍。\n岁寒共喜坚松柏，世事那知变海桑。\n慷慨捐躯探虎穴，凄凉归骨葬螺冈。\n忠魂万古留遗恨，潜德千年有耿光。\n许远不忘唐社稷，苏卿犹著汉文章。\n哀歌有尽情无尽，稍稍悲风起白杨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31697,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽曾侍郎得之","author":"邓雅","text":"圣主求贤问治安，先生承诏起江干。\n百年事业存经济，万里云霄振羽翰。\n制作尽稽周典礼，风流不减晋衣冠。\n丹墀奏对天颜近，画省论思月色寒。\n道学每期千载重，文章底用后人看。\n病思启箧焚遗藁，诏许还山别上官。\n记就玉楼仙梦远，粉书丹旐客心酸。\n祠堂万古屏山麓，松柏参天集凤鸾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31698,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贽芊知事希曾十韵","author":"邓雅","text":"临江知事扬州客，漂泊风尘历岁年。\n老大独怜双鬓改，乱离兼喜一家全。\n山中寓隐从门掩，松下遨游任履穿。\n经雨欲锄栽竹地，久晴思引灌花泉。\n朋来问字能携酒，客至求诗每费笺。\n政誉已闻天上有，才名姑与郡中传。\n飞腾万里曾如愿，留滞三年暂息肩。\n贫似杜陵收橡栗，兴同彭泽忆芜田。\n黄麻有待恩光及，白屋深期惠泽宣。\n感激为公歌此曲，异时相率共留鞭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31699,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨花用丁御史韵","author":"邓雅","text":"绿杨堤上起鲜飙，无数飞花映日娇。\n稍近楼台度帘幕，忽沾杯斝绚琼瑶。\n灞陵吟望春偏好，彭泽行寻路匪遥。\n照眼适同张绪态，多情浑似小蛮腰。\n轻随戏蝶飘邻圃，急送游人过市桥。\n村白不禁芒履踏，店香须赴酒家邀。\n难收弱絮从衣薄，错认柔丝把鬓撩。\n摇荡度江千万里，颠狂辞树两三朝。\n残春莫怪犹飞雪，明日重看定化薸。\n底事诗人频赋咏，绣衣曾惹上丹霄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31700,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉笥十咏（曾伯曼命题） 其一 玉笥晴云","author":"邓雅","text":"三十六峰杳难分，上有佳气常氤氲。\n安得良工拂绢素，画我山中眠白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31701,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉笥十咏（曾伯曼命题） 其二 紫盖春雨","author":"邓雅","text":"紫盖突兀青天位，老鹤结巢松树枝。\n坐看山色净如染，正是东风过雨时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31702,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉笥十咏（曾伯曼命题） 其三 何君驾虹","author":"邓雅","text":"紫霄何年驾綵虹，三十万里登瀛蓬。\n至今岩洞有遗迹，碧桃烂熳摇春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31703,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉笥十咏（曾伯曼命题） 其四 石人玩月","author":"邓雅","text":"望夫化石千古名，玩月如人千古清。\n梅花峰上月皎皎，此物无情如有情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31704,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉笥十咏（曾伯曼命题） 其五 双林莲社","author":"邓雅","text":"寻僧几向山中来，芒鞋踏破青青苔。\n双林绝似东林好，亦有白莲无数开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31705,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉笥十咏（曾伯曼命题） 其六 孤山梅隐","author":"邓雅","text":"孤山山中小有天，时有隐者来盘旋。\n梅花如雪千万树，徙倚月下怀逋仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31706,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉笥十咏（曾伯曼命题） 其七 绵峰瀑布","author":"邓雅","text":"谁拖素练千尺长，乃是绝壁飞流浪。\n上人洗钵坐崖石，惯闻水乐鸣铿锵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31707,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉笥十咏（曾伯曼命题） 其八 茧溪澄练","author":"邓雅","text":"茧溪下从西北流，明月正照芦花秋。\n秋光涵映一匹练，天地与我同虚舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31708,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉笥十咏（曾伯曼命题） 其九 南祠梦阁","author":"邓雅","text":"化龙楼阁成墟丘，世人无梦登瀛洲。\n倦来偶枕松下石，天风六月凉如秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31709,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉笥十咏（曾伯曼命题） 其十 东岳行宫","author":"邓雅","text":"岱宗如何齐鲁青，鲁侯昔祭山之灵。\n江淮远隔数千里，空山落木看祠庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31710,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题秋月上人所藏洞庭秋月图","author":"邓雅","text":"君山木落洞庭秋，今古无穷水自流。\n明月一轮天宇静，定中疑是泛虚舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31711,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪","author":"邓雅","text":"一夜天花满世间，群峰失却翠云鬟。\n何由骑得仙家鹤，看遍东南万玉山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31712,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题扇","author":"邓雅","text":"林间楼阁护烟霞，门外山童埽落花。\n小涧石桥人缓步，抱琴来此访仙家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31713,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题昭君图","author":"邓雅","text":"一曲琵琶千种恨，百年图画几人看。\n君王不是无恩宠，海宇因之得奠安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31714,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒居","author":"邓雅","text":"一林修竹满庭阴，四壁图书太古心。\n俯仰乾坤观物理，悠然鱼鸟自飞沉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31715,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题观海图","author":"邓雅","text":"沧溟之深几千丈，万顷镜面涵空虚。\n何不翻身入海底，九重渊内探骊珠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31716,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画扇","author":"邓雅","text":"青松掩映白云间，云自无心我自閒。\n静听松声作琴响，孤鸾别鹤不须弹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31717,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为吴叔昌题画扇","author":"邓雅","text":"山中老树半荣枯，烟际茅亭似有无。\n白发两翁携稚子，衣冠疑是列仙徒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31718,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客夜 其一","author":"邓雅","text":"芙蓉叶上雨潇潇，一盏残灯照寂寥。\n久客不堪乡思苦，谁家儿女又吹箫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31719,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客夜 其二","author":"邓雅","text":"洞箫吹彻思悠悠，云散江天月满楼。\n倚遍阑干风露冷，数声孤雁落沧洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31720,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采莲曲 其一","author":"邓雅","text":"粉黛妆成宫样新，汗凝微涴紫罗巾。\n绝怜来往西湖上，贪看荷花不顾人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31721,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采莲曲 其二","author":"邓雅","text":"绿荷深处水生波，三五兰舟载绮罗。\n华月渐明风渐息，吴人愁听越人歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31722,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋谢仲宁纸帐","author":"邓雅","text":"溪藤百幅净如练，裁作斗帐同君清。\n觉来满洞白云起，耳畔更听松风声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31723,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重游何君郊居有感","author":"邓雅","text":"板桥流水石矶平，几度经行酒半醒。\n试问隔堤杨柳树，为谁摇落为谁青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31724,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭出家从祖德林真人","author":"邓雅","text":"万里天风送佩珂，一丘烟雨暗松萝。\n伤心二十四涧水，不及诸孙涕泪多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31725,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对桐树","author":"邓雅","text":"丈夫志气颇英豪，流落兹山叹未遭。\n却羡翠桐门外树，小窗坐见出檐高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31726,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"应制赋钟山云气冱寒诗首句乃御制也","author":"邓雅","text":"冱寒云鸿濛，维时届严冬。\n乾坤既定位，造化乃有功。\n圣人昌国运，父老歌年丰。\n鳌足立四极，钟山蟠一龙。\n风云常变化，草木自葱茏。\n帝德迈三五，君门深九重。\n金陵势佳丽，芒砀气郁葱。\n永世立基业，群经知统宗。\n华夷遵教化，臣子效精忠。\n三诰比谟典，万几思始终。\n忧民至恳切，论道每从容。\n田野被闿泽，闾阎还古风。\n咨询及耆老，歌舞效儿童。\n承诏上金殿，命题劳圣衷。\n臣才实蹇涩，臣貌复龙钟。\n岂有涓埃报，深知眷顾隆。\n上林春欲动，大地雪犹封。\n何物耐寒气，青青万年松。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31727,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贽周参议（名倬字云章丰城人）","author":"邓雅","text":"秘阁曾看万卷书，文章政事近无如。\n丰城两剑降妖魅，北极诸星拱帝居。\n海宇无疆归正统，朝廷有道用真儒。\n攀龙直到九天上，附骥何当万里馀。\n涸辙久思求活计，侯门那得曳长裾。\n春风倘借吹嘘力，寒谷春生槁朽苏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31728,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早朝","author":"邓雅","text":"九重城阙五云中，万国衣冠拜衮龙。\n道德仰瞻天地大，车书复见古今同。\n凤凰池暖春先动，鳷鹊楼高雪正融。\n头白趋朝沾圣泽，几回吟对万年松。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31729,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新淦晓发","author":"邓雅","text":"淦水东头晓发船，邑人争看去朝天。\n老人星现当平治，圣主恩深被宠宣。\n身到九重依日月，路经千里越山川。\n此行得遂平生志，归课儿孙种秫田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31730,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南津夜泊","author":"邓雅","text":"南津桥头明月多，客船夜泊发讴歌。\n五更霜寒闻画角，千里帆开扬素波。\n朝廷有道恤耆老，天地无私含太和。\n妙音伫听奏韶濩，九重城阙高嵯峨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31731,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚宿清江","author":"邓雅","text":"金凤州前落日低，清江城下泊船时。\n白头总是朝天客，黄柳齐攀系缆枝。\n万里云霄悲旅雁，千家砧杵捣寒衣。\n明朝拟拜黄堂守，却驾天风去似飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31732,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊樟镇谒宝金山","author":"邓雅","text":"清江之水清悠悠，行人发棹江之头。\n封溪晚泊集千艇，宝金晨谒登层楼。\n山川感慨今古事，草木变衰天地秋。\n我来再拜何所祝，四海永清蒙帝休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31733,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晨起","author":"邓雅","text":"曾从玉洞看云松，又向金门拜衮龙。\n四海岂无青眼士，满船俱是白头翁。\n夜瞻斗柄天旋左，朝望扶桑日上东。\n最喜太平今有象，赐归何幸乐年丰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31734,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"到江西","author":"邓雅","text":"朔风吹雁不成行，独起掀蓬思渺茫。\n万里青天看北斗，数声柔橹下西江。\n滕王旧阁何年废，孺子高名百世香。\n我欲题诗纪形胜，气冲牛斗笔如杠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31735,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滕王阁","author":"邓雅","text":"天下几多奇绝处，滕王独爱此淹留。\n山瞻庐岳九千丈，地控荆蛮十二州。\n天上星辰分翼轸，阁中风景自春秋。\n朱帘画栋非畴昔，江水依然万古流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31736,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望湖亭读坡仙诗景仰高风重题四韵","author":"邓雅","text":"不识眉山苏学士，望湖亭上忆高风。\n心胸自可吞彭蠡，眉宇何如见华峰。\n旧日题诗留篆刻，平生为国守精忠。\n文章千古谁能似，湖水滔滔日向东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31737,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴城山","author":"邓雅","text":"西湖水落天风寒，维舟又上吴城山。\n禅林楼阁烂金碧，洞府神仙鸣佩环。\n浩浩乾坤宽眼界，翩翩鸾鹤下云间。\n登临正乐催行急，诏许龙墀趁晓班。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31738,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"星子县阻风","author":"邓雅","text":"冬十二月朝天关，我船正泊星子湾。\n祈灵已谒晏侯庙，举目更望匡庐山。\n风涛汹涌阻行色，岁事峥嵘悲旅颜。\n是身安得生羽翼，飞上九天浑未艰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31739,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庐山","author":"邓雅","text":"五老擎天压厚坤，江南惟有此山尊。\n千岩楼阁多仙佛，四面峰蛮似子孙。\n飞瀑恍疑银汉落，悬崖时有白云屯。\n何当独跨山头鹤，万里飘飘朝帝阍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31740,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安庆吊青阳先生余廷心","author":"邓雅","text":"江云淡淡江水清，吊古又上舒州城。\n青阳先生不可见，群玉山人空复情。\n一门骨肉死贞节，千古文章留姓名。\n高风激烈孰能比，李黻守潭当并称。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31741,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"欲到丰城不果","author":"邓雅","text":"可惜丰城地，船中瞥眼过。\n楼台新雉堞，戎马旧山河。\n龙剑知谁得，虬须奈老何。\n临风屡回首，重到恐蹉跎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31742,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孺子亭观东湖","author":"邓雅","text":"西山含夕照，征棹泊钟陵。\n未上滕王阁，先游孺子亭。\n古今留胜迹，江海寄閒情。\n试问东湖水，何人此濯缨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31743,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"铁柱观","author":"邓雅","text":"铁柱井中央，蛟龙久遁藏。\n神功配天地，剑气厉风霜。\n世已除妖孽，仙犹托混茫。\n应知万万古，为国镇西江。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31744,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"樵舍","author":"邓雅","text":"樵舍临江浒，柴门数十家。\n驿亭依柳树，客棹泊汀沙。\n岁晏风霜肃，天长道路赊。\n舟师告群老，十日到京华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31745,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昌邑山","author":"邓雅","text":"水落江心正，人行岸脚斜。\n祠神过水府，倚棹近渔家。\n饮啄宜沙鸟，漂流愧客槎。\n戍兵严警逻，为报上京华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31746,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九江口","author":"邓雅","text":"路出九江口，山瞻五老峰。\n天高飞鹳鹤，浪暖化鱼龙。\n极目微茫外，扬帆浩荡中。\n观流问源委，巴蜀此相通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31747,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜泊南康","author":"邓雅","text":"向夕扁舟系，南康一水遥。\n角声云外响，灯影浪中摇。\n漂泊怜衰鬓，讴歌答圣朝。\n北风阻行色，明发待齐桡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31748,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖口","author":"邓雅","text":"县舍临湖口，僧居倚石岩。\n路斜通柳市，风急挂蒲帆。\n异境堪图画，同舟共笑谈。\n争知种田者，头白著征衫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31749,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"彭泽","author":"邓雅","text":"山通彭泽县，天设海门关。\n万水潴清浊，千艘渡险艰。\n望洋今日叹，承诏几时还。\n欲访陶潜宅，闻风有愧颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31750,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采石","author":"邓雅","text":"蛾眉亭上奏朱弦，采石江边月满船。\n惆怅谪仙何处在，醉中犹伴老龙眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31751,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"采石酒楼","author":"邓雅","text":"采石江头问酒家，酒楼儿女貌如花。\n金杯满劝歌声缓，银烛高烧舞影斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31752,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观潮有感","author":"邓雅","text":"潮去潮来朝复暮，花开花落雨兼风。\n由来万化皆消长，惟有青山今古同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31753,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]